# Local Claude Code state. Holds git worktrees for research branches — checkouts,
# not content. The research itself lives in the research/* branches on origin.
.claude/

# Session handoffs and working notes — the bridge between context windows.
# Ephemeral by construction: what survives a handoff belongs in an issue, an
# ADR, or CONTEXT.md, not here.
.scratch/

node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo

# The published data artefacts, removed at the tip on #147 (ADR-0026 §4): the
# repository publishes the code, not the harvest. A local run still regenerates
# all four, so they are ignored to keep them from being re-committed.
#
# ⚠️ This is a **safety net, not the mechanism**. `.gitignore` does not stop an
# explicit `git add <path>`, and `daily.yml`'s commit-back step names these paths
# explicitly — so the schedule that drives it being retired is what actually
# keeps them out, and this ignore only catches a stray manual add.
data/calendar.sqlite
site/calendar.json
site/feeds/*.ics

# SQLite WAL sidecars — transient journal state a running process owns. (The
# store itself, data/calendar.sqlite, is no longer committed either; see above.)
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
